{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:49 2026-08-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:49 2026-08-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:49 2026-08-06 HKT</p><p>今日（6日）早上8時24分，有途人發現昂船洲大橋橋底有一具人形物體載浮載沉。救援人員到場在海中撈起一名男子，送往青衣消防輪碼頭。救護員經檢驗後證實男子當場不治，警方正調查其身份及墮海原因。</p><img alt=\"救援人員將男子送往青衣消防輪碼頭。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/075622039cf422b1aef5e1c115657f8f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_09_36_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a3d5601cd20b2293317443a607ebe9b1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_09_36_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"救援人員將男子送往青衣消防輪碼頭。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f28996914949f41445fa240cad81e345/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_09_36_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ed73dca63f66b5b75cad0118e84d86a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_09_36_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8254d496b7ff8b393e2eca2530eed305/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_09_36_37.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3bf7918a58c4aa3384e3448d5bfb4031/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_09_36_36.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T01:58:54.960335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}